            0.084,
            0.884,
            0.145
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "food, and they grow. They also respire, reproduce, excrete, respond to stimuli, and eventually, die. Absence of any of these features indicates that they are "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "non-living",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " things."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.145,
            0.883,
            0.206
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now that you know how to identify a living being, fill up the remaining two columns (IV and V) of Table 10.1 and complete the activity."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.207,
            0.883,
            0.247
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In which category would you place a seed—living or non-living? Why?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.247,
            0.883,
            0.29
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "explore",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " how a seed germinates to observe some of these essential characteristics in plants."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.256,
            0.306,
            0.81,
            0.357
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10.2 Essential Conditions for Germination of a Seed"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.253,
            0.368,
            0.885,
            0.494
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Have you observed a seed germinating? You might have wondered what conditions are required for "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "germination",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of a seed. What conditions do you think are required for seed germination? How will you investigate whether these conditions have an effect on the germination of a seed? Let us find out by performing Activity 10.2."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.503,
            0.605,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 10.2: Let us experiment"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.256,
            0.535,
            0.883,
            0.599
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Take four identical pots filled with garden soil. Sow four bean seeds in each pot. Now, keep these pots in the following conditions for 15 days."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.298,
            0.604,
            0.883,
            0.649
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Pot A: Do not water the soil. Place this pot in direct sunlight."
            }
          ]
        },
